{
  "title": "FlowMLLab: An Open-Source Framework for Reproducible CFD-to-Scientific-Machine-Learning Experiments",
  "description": "FlowMLLab v1.13.0 adds 45 actual cavity CFD fields on three grids, all seven Ghia cases, high-Re mesh/time sensitivity, and a full-field POD-DeepONet with whole-Re tests, matched interpolation baselines and retained validation-driven training-data augmentation. Two new executed student notebooks and six Week-4 lecture pages explain representation, optimization and physical/numerical limits. Earlier notebooks, frozen profile models and original lecture pages are preserved. High-Re mesh sensitivity remains material; neural error is relative to the stated CFD discretization, not exact physical truth.",
